TIP:  There's a fairly simple alternating root strum that continues throughout the song.  For the (G) it's the 6th and 5th string, for the (C) it's the 5th and 4th strings, and for the (D) it's the 4th and 5th strings.

TIP:  Note the lingering chord changes at the end of the line rather than the beginning of the next line.  All about the cadence.


